+
+## Erasing a person
+
+An administrator can use **Remove** on the people list to permanently erase an account. For accounts deactivated by an older version, open **Previously removed people** on the same list. Erasure is per person; upgrading does not automatically delete those accounts.
+
+Books the person created with **Everyone** access keep their contents and readers, with the byline **Deleted author**. Their other books are deleted, including revisions and uploads. This operation applies to the live application; separately retained backups and infrastructure logs are subject to your deployment’s retention policy.
